== SURF_WINDOW
# WINDOW (§5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-1 ; DELTA14 F1 / D2 w9, R-F1, R-F10, premise10 N10-9 / NP10-1): a trait impl off
# ALLOWED_IMPLS admitted for the ONE type a row names, the trait one of WINDOW_TRAITS (Deref, DerefMut) ; each row
# names its deleting unit and the date it was admitted ; a row no impl matches is STALE. The stores' text door w9:
# `Keyed<V>` / `KeyedSet` (lexscope/key.rs) reach the std map / set they hold until DK3-b deletes the four impls.
type	trait	unit	since
Keyed	Deref	DK3-b	2026-11-23
Keyed	DerefMut	DK3-b	2026-11-23
KeyedSet	Deref	DK3-b	2026-11-23
KeyedSet	DerefMut	DK3-b	2026-11-23
