== SURF_CARD
# CARD (DELTA11 R2): an OUT position holding Option / Vec / a slice / an array / two or more
# `bool`, with MEANS (hand): caller | hit:<question> | list:<what> ; a missing row FAILS CARD,
# a row matching no position is STALE. First rows at LS2a.
item	position	type	means
ScopeKeyed::take_at	RET	Option<V>	hit:a value stored at the carried scope
ScopeKeyed::drain_keys_shown	RET	Vec<Shown>	list:the scopes still holding a value
Keyed::get_new	RET	Option<&V>	hit:a value stored under the key
Keyed::insert_new	RET	Option<V>	hit:the value the key held before the insert
Keyed::remove_new	RET	Option<V>	hit:the value the key held
